*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow/Giraffe Cat]] or any other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] to quickly get the timed rewards.

